{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b099b0ff-6a5a-8485-9739-2fe0628cc70b",
  "created_at": "2026-01-20T12:00:49-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Declan Kearney",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:58:35-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:58:40-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Lorraine. Declan Kearney here. Let me explain, I'm on my cell and I'm actually stopped at a railroad crossing in Portsmouth, so if I cut out, that's why."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:58:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, no problem. Take your time. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:58:55-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So, my street hasn't been plowed since the last storm. That's going on a good while now. I'm at 275 Gidley Street, in the Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:59:05-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "275 Gidley Street. And it hasn't been plowed at all since the storm?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:59:11-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not once that I've seen. Plow went down the main road, and that was it. Then we had the cold snap come in, and it's been sitting there packed down and frozen. We got a dusting overnight on top of it, so now it's just a skating rink with a little powder on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:59:31-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's the worst, when it freezes up like that. Let me make sure I have this right, Gidley Street, the whole block, or just your end?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:59:41-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I can only speak for the stretch by my house. I left at seven this morning and it was the same as it was Saturday. [line breaks up] ...and the cars are, um, sliding sideways pulling out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:59:55-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You broke up there for a second. You said cars are sliding when they pull out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:00:02-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Sliding. So my question is pretty simple. When is somebody going to clear it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:00:08-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't have an exact time for you, I'll be honest. I can put in a request for Gidley Street right now so it goes to the crew supervisor, and they decide the order of the streets. Is a callback number okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:00:24-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0189."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:00:26-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0189. And that's Declan Kearney, 275 Gidley Street, unplowed since the storm, icy with a light dusting on top."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:00:34-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all correct. Okay, the gates are going up, so I've got to go. I'd appreciate it if someone looks at it today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:00:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll flag it that way. Drive safe, Mr. Kearney."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:00:47-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Lorraine."
    }
  ],
